        { 'name' => 'remove', 'kind' => 'method', 'summary' => 'When C<to-remove> is a single item, C<remove> reduces the weight of that item by one.  If this results in the item having a weight of 0, this removes the item from the C<BagHash>.  If the item is not present in the C<BagHash>, C<remove> has no effect.  When C<to-remove> is a L<C<List>|/type/List>, L<C<Array>|/type/Array>, L<C<Seq>|/type/Seq>, or any other type that C<does> the L<C«Iterator»|/type/Iterator> Role, C<remove> reduces the weight of', 'sigs' => ['method remove(BagHash: \\to-remove, *%_ --> Nil)'], 'returns' => ['Nil'] },
